# Portal Invariants

Next.js 15 auth-first (`src`). Detail: `docs/operational/ARCHITECTURE.md`, `E2E-TESTIDS.md`, `portal-base` skill.

## Layers (bắt buộc)

`app/` + `components/` → `hooks/` → `services/` + `stores/` → `validations/` + `@portal/models` → `apiFetch`

- No `apiFetch` in page/component · no reverse import from `models/`
- Form: `react-hook-form` + `validations/` + `models/` · contract: `portal-contract-naming.mdc`
- Add feature: `models` → `services` → `stores?` → `hooks` → `validations` → `app/` + `testId`

## UI · size · E2E · imports

- Tiers: `ui/` → `molecules/mo-*` → `organisms/data-*` · dashboard = `app/(dashboard)/layout.tsx` shadcn only
- Registry: `registries/design.registry.json` · `#shell: DataListPage` · `portal-design-vocabulary.mdc` (glob)
- ~200 lines/file · ~20 lines/fn → `portal-code-size.mdc` (glob)
- Playwright + `data-testid` before spec → `portal-base-ui-testid.mdc`, `portal-base-e2e.mdc` (glob)
- Imports: `@/` trong `src` — no `../` → `portal-import-alias.mdc` (glob)
